WEBVTT

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:08.860
It's done!

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.360
Escha's special pancake stack!

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:17.880
I made a few changes to the recipe, and added more cream!

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:22.410
And so, let me taste it!

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:26.500
I'm so happy!

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:27.590
Another bite!

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.130
It's tasty!

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.300
Another one!

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:37.930
I'm melting away!

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.860
One more bite-

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:24.040
She sure is late.

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:26.670
Today's supposed to be her first day.

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:28.510
Marion-san!

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:33.540
This girl came to the atelier looking for R&D.

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:36.270
Oh, so that's where you were.

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.030
Sorry I'm late.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.310
That's fine.

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:40.930
Let me introduce her to you.

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:46.160
This is Lucille Ernella-san. She'll be joining the R&D Division starting today.

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:47.360
Nice to meet you.

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:49.250
I look forward to working with you.

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:53.150
So she's a new member.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:57.230
I know this is sudden, but Escha-chan, Logy-kun,

00:02:57.230 --> 00:03:00.860
will you two show her the ropes?

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:02.320
Yes, understood.

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:04.450
Nice to meet you, Lucille-chan.

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:06.660
Yes, um...

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.690
Logy-senpai! Escha-senpai!

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:09.660
S-Senpai?

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.750
I see. Senpai, huh?

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:16.340
All right! Let's do our best!

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:19.170
Okay, we'll start with paperwork.

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:23.380
Try to copy down the names and prices on this list in a <i>flash</i>,

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:24.760
organize it with a <i>wham</i>,

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:27.670
and tally it with a <i>bang</i>!

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:29.340
Understood!

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:34.510
I'm done!

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:35.190
Already?

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.770
Amazing.

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:37.780
It's perfect.

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:43.830
Then next up, find the info on this memo.

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:44.950
Yes.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:51.100
Escha-senpai, I've found everything!

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:52.000
Already?

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:54.500
Do you need me to find anything else?

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:59.600
Then how about this and this?

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:01.470
Okay! Leave it to me!

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:04.130
She's quite capable.

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:06.470
T-That's true...

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.600
You're amazing, Lucille-chan.

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:13.060
You'd probably do fine without us showing you anything.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.650
You might handle things even better than Escha.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.310
Not at all.

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:18.710
Escha-senpai is much more amazing.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:23.820
Didn't you use alchemy to make medicine to purify the northern village's water?

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:27.160
I read the report in the archives just now.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.410
When did you...

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:33.080
I've studied medicine because I want to help people.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:36.290
That's why I really admire what you did.

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:40.150
C-Come on, you're embarrassing me.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:42.150
Thank you, though.

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:44.800
It's pretty amazing you studied medicine.

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:49.600
My dream is to rid this world of disease.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.970
That's a wonderful dream.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:57.650
If there were more people like you, my mother would...

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:01.900
She passed away in an epidemic when Escha was a kid.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:04.660
I see.

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:05.920
I'm sorry.

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.240
I didn't know.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:09.270
Oh, no, that's fine.

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:12.910
I don't feel lonely at all.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:17.740
But had that happened when I was just a bit older, I probably would've been quite sad.

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:20.380
That's why I support your dream, Lucille-chan!

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:23.590
Thank you.

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:27.110
I already told you I don't buy that kind of junk!

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:29.410
You sure have no sense of taste.

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:30.100
Huh?

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:32.420
What's the problem, Reyfer-san?

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:34.520
Oh, Escha-chan.

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:38.410
I am trying to sell some treasure,

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:40.920
but she doesn't understand its value at all.

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.530
That's cute!

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.650
This is the first time I've seen something like this!

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:49.470
Oh, I would like to buy it!

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:51.030
Huh?

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:55.410
Oh, young lady, looks like you understand the value of this doll.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:56.500
Yes!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:59.750
This is part of a very popular series of dolls in Central City.

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:04.960
This particular cow is an ultra rare doll that's only sold in this area.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:07.070
Eh? Really?

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:07.990
Yes!

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:10.220
Um, how much would you like for it?

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:12.720
How about 10,000 cole?

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.350
That's expensive!

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:17.390
Reyfer-san, that's crazy!

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:18.510
That's right.

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:21.770
With that much money, you can have lunch at Duke's place fifty times.

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:23.470
See?

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:25.900
Anyone would react like that.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.560
You wanted me to give you 10,000 for that?

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:28.360
That's funny.

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:31.680
You should give up on it too.

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:33.370
I don't really mind.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:34.270
Eh?!

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:36.870
All right! I'm in luck today!

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:40.880
Um, Reyfer-san, about what we were discussing...

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:45.340
Katla would like to buy it, please.

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:45.340
Okay. Deal.

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:47.890
Sold to the young lady.

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:49.890
Thank you.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.720
N-No way!

00:06:56.120 --> 00:07:00.190
I wonder what kind of family Lucille-chan was brought up in.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.020
Who knows?

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:06.150
I think I've heard of the name Ernella somewhere, though.

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:10.820
Homunculi.

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:13.910
Solle. The job. It's done.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.520
Pay me.

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:17.330
Okay, I understand.

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.410
Your payment. Give.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:21.640
Wait. Just a while.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:23.730
We'll hold you to that, Solle.

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:26.150
Sparkles! Sparkles!

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:28.150
They're so cute.

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:31.170
So that's how you talk to them, Solle-san.

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:34.590
Yeah, well, it was quite difficult at first.

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:37.630
Once you get used to it, it's quite a clear and concise way of speaking.

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:40.040
This is from Chief Marion.

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:43.560
So what kind of work do they do?

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:48.410
Unlike humans, they have very special powers.

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:50.870
Among them is the ability to replicate items.

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:54.490
If you ask, they can make a copy of almost anything.

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:58.120
For example, the supplies that R&D uses.

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:00.550
They can do that?

00:08:00.550 --> 00:08:02.080
I never knew that.

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:05.760
Um, by the way, what do you pay them?

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:07.290
We give them these sweets.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:10.570
It just happens my hobby is making sweets and desserts.

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:13.800
I was eating some on my break, and they asked me for some.

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:19.560
I couldn't give them these because I don't have enough to fully compensate them.

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:23.980
Sweets, huh?

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:31.530
This is all I have.

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:34.360
Will they talk to me?

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.240
Sparkles! Sparkles!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.620
Sparkles!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.620
I want some!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.190
I want some too! Sparkles!

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:41.670
What?

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:43.890
You. New face.

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:45.500
What's your name.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:49.290
Um, my name is Lucille.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:51.430
Call me Lucille.

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:53.030
Lucille. Got it.

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:54.820
Lucille. Memorised it.

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:57.870
Lucille, what's your job?

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:01.930
I'm still new here, so many different things.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:03.970
I'm learning something new everyday!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:10.870
We also memorise many things. Many studies.

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:13.210
We do our best.

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:15.780
Lucille, try your best?

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:18.640
Yes, I'm trying my best.

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:21.620
Oh, this isn't good.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.460
I need to go for today.

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:26.370
If I have time, may I come talk to you again?

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:28.080
You continue?

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.050
I can keep listening to you talk?

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:31.420
Yes, of course!

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:36.310
Okay! First, Lucille, you talk! Wanna listen!

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:37.640
Wanna listen!

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:40.350
Thank you!

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:46.280
Central City sent us a request to make vaccines for a disease.

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:48.360
It seems they want to gather production samples from different people

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:51.650
and take the most effective one and commercialise it.

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:54.260
Vaccine, huh?

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:56.280
So there's another epidemic.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:03.170
As this helps people, I want our R&D to take this request.

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:04.660
What do you think?

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:09.490
I wonder if we can make a recipe for a vaccine to combat an epidemic.

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:10.490
Yeah.

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:15.210
U-Um, could I try my hand at making the vaccine?

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:17.590
Huh? You?

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:20.600
That's right!

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:23.870
You studied medicine in Central City!

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:27.330
If I recall, you mentioned that you had experience in that area.

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:30.060
Please leave this to me!

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:33.440
I want to rid this world of disease!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.750
Got it.

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:41.490
I'll leave this to you, then.

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:44.490
Lucille-chan, we'll help you.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:47.870
Even though this isn't my specialty, I'm sure I can help somehow.

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:51.390
No, all of you have your own work.

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:53.830
I will do this by myself.

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:55.750
Will you really be okay on your own?

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:59.260
Yes! If it's medicine, leave it to me.

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:01.970
I will definitely make it!

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:09.690
First I have to come up with a recipe.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:19.530
Lucille...

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:23.570
Lucille. Lately, very busy.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:26.040
Lucille-chan.

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:28.980
Senpai, are you here for work?

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:30.100
Nope.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:32.750
You've been working on it all by yourself, so I was worried.

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:36.110
Maybe we should help you.

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:37.710
No, it's okay.

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:41.310
I'm doing this because I want to.

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:42.590
I'll do my best!

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:43.970
Really?

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:45.890
Yes!

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.620
Is she really okay?

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:56.550
Um... what does this word mean?

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:58.070
You sure are working hard.

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:00.220
I'm going home now.

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:02.270
What about you, Lucille-chan?

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:04.430
You were here pretty late last night.

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:06.450
I want to finish just a little more before I go.

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:07.990
I see.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.440
Don't overdo it.

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:09.950
Yes!

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:15.380
A little longer.

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:17.590
Just a little longer.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.630
Lucille is late.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:23.300
Did something happen?

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:26.390
The deadline to submit the vaccine is coming up.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:30.780
It just so happens I wanted to ask her about her progress today.

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:31.500
Huh?

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.100
What's wrong, Chief?

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:36.550
This doesn't look anywhere near done!

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:37.250
Eh?!

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:38.670
You're right.

00:12:38.670 --> 00:12:39.980
This doesn't look even remotely ready.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.050
How did this happen?

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:44.950
This is my mistake as her supervisor.

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:46.740
Do we have enough time to finish it?

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.260
I don't know.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:51.370
We might need to contact them and cancel the request.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.330
W-Wait a moment!

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:55.690
Let's check with Lucille-chan first.

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:57.880
I'll go visit her.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:58.670
Wait up!

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:02.930
Lucille-chan, are you there?

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:04.630
If you are, come out!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:06.420
Lucille-chan!

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:12.280
Lucille... chan?

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:15.230
Escha-senpai!

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:17.650
Are you okay? Lucille-chan!

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:19.150
Lucille-chan!

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:26.610
What a gorgeous room.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:29.990
I'm very sorry for making you worry.

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:31.730
Don't worry about that.

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:35.390
In any case, why did you work yourself until you collapsed?

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:41.380
I wanted to prove that I have the ability to make medicine myself.

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:42.960
Prove?

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:46.240
Even during my time in Central City,

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:49.930
I've been bad at reading the ancient language needed to study medicine.

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:55.770
And so I was unable to participate in any development .

00:13:56.050 --> 00:14:05.400
Even my father told me, "You are not fit to make medicine, so give up and help with the family business."

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:07.010
That logo...

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:09.240
So Ernella meant Ernella Pharmaceuticals.

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:11.600
Ernella Pharmaceuticals?

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:15.170
It's a company that sells medicine in Central City,

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:16.410
and Lucille is their...

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:19.040
Yes, their daughter.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.810
Aren't you a noble lady, then?

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:24.210
You don't need to work for money.

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:28.190
Even so, I want to do my part for this world!

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:30.040
That's why I left my family,

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:36.130
and kept looking for a place where I could pursue my dreams.

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:37.060
But...

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:41.370
After coming here, the vaccine issue came up, right?

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:44.690
But I still can't read the ancient language.

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:47.360
I couldn't finish it!

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:52.570
Even though I asked to do it, and said I'd be fine doing it myself,

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:55.540
in the end, I don't have the talent for making medicine!

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:56.450
You're wrong!

00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:59.500
The only thing you've done wrong is trying to do it all yourself.

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:03.030
You have to let yourself rely on others!

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:06.730
Logy-san?

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:08.670
No, I'm sorry.

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:09.760
I just...

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:11.350
Please don't mind me.

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:13.910
No, it's exactly as you said.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:19.980
Just like he said, you shouldn't try to do everything by yourself.

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:24.410
Sorry that I left you all alone.

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:25.880
Escha-senpai.

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:28.010
But everything will be fine now.

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:29.990
Let's all work together!

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:33.410
So let's not give up just yet, okay?

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:38.250
Yes!

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:41.400
Then, you need to get some rest first.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:43.840
Until you feel better, let us take care of it.

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:43.660
That's right.

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:45.250
You still have a chance, Lucille.

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:45.250
Thank you, Senpai!

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:47.840
Unlike me.

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.800
Okay! Let's do it, Logy-san!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:54.340
A vaccine for an epidemic?

00:15:55.990 --> 00:15:57.100
In that case...

00:15:57.690 --> 00:16:02.600
You should understand the different diseases once you read the pages I bookmarked.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:06.060
Thanks!

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:08.100
Deciphering the ancient language?

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:09.990
I'm sorry to ask you while you are busy.

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:12.590
Don't worry about it.

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:14.110
Just leave it there.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:16.700
Thank you!

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:19.200
Sorry for the wait!

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:22.250
Lucille has recovered!

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:25.040
We've been waiting, Lucille-chan!

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:30.010
I just got the deciphered ancient language text from Threia.

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:32.030
What do you think?

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:33.890
That's a lot!

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:36.510
Thank you very much for everything!

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:40.220
I'll definitely finish the recipe this time!

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:51.610
It's done.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.360
It's done!

00:16:55.570 --> 00:17:00.580
But I wonder if I'll be able to get the ingredients for this recipe.

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:03.550
We'll take care of that.

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:06.330
We'll get them regardless of how dangerous the places are.

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:10.190
Logy-senpai! Linca-senpai!

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:12.470
We're back.

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:14.220
Lucille, how are these ingredients?

00:17:17.440 --> 00:17:19.480
Such high quality!

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:22.850
They must have been very hard to get.

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:26.430
It was no problem at all.

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:29.730
Lucille-chan, will this Supplement work?

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:32.610
That's amazing, Escha-senpai!

00:17:33.010 --> 00:17:37.280
This white supplement will probably enhance the medicine's effect.

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:39.890
Just leave the rest to me!

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:44.710
I will finish it successfully!

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:49.000
It's done!

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:52.130
This is...

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:53.590
It's made with that recipe...

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:58.010
Lucille-chan, this is the vaccine that you thought up.

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:59.800
Now, turn it in!

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:01.450
Yes!

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:10.690
Everyone.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.710
I got a call.

00:18:13.930 --> 00:18:16.740
With respect to the vaccine we turned in,

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:20.570
we have finally received the results.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:25.870
The vaccine recipe that Lucille developed has been chosen!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.660
You did it, Lucille!

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:31.390
That's awesome, Lucille-chan!

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:32.040
Yes!

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:34.840
Lucille-chan, this is from the client who made the request.

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:38.670
Looks like it's a letter of appreciation.

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:40.590
For me?

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:43.180
This is... from my father?!

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:48.560
So that vaccine request was from Ernella Pharmaceuticals.

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:50.810
I only just found out myself.

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:52.730
Father...

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:57.190
"Thank you for making such a fine medicine."

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:59.820
"You did a great job and never gave up."

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:02.280
"I see you in a new light now."

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:05.290
Isn't it great that he recognises you now?

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:12.600
But without all of your help, I wouldn't have been able to make the medicine.

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:15.670
That's why... even though he praised me,

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:18.800
I still can't accomplish anything by myself.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.180
Don't say that.

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:24.040
It's important for everyone to work together.

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:27.390
So how about we work together from now on?

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:30.110
Escha-senpai!

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:32.980
Yes!

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:37.150
One, two...!

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:37.910
Welcome!

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:39.650
Welcome to the Apple House!

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:43.300
This is wonderful!

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:46.870
Everyone, thanks for inviting me here!

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:50.390
It looks delicious!

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:53.960
Um, Nio-san, Wilbell-san.

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:57.170
Thank you for all your help.

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:59.610
If you need anything else, just ask.

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:01.930
Even if it's just for fun, it's okay to ask us.

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:04.550
Keep who I am a secret, though.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:06.950
Yes, I understand.

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:08.690
Okay, then.

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:12.770
I propose a toast to the success of Lucille-chan's vaccine!

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:14.600
Cheers!

00:20:17.590 --> 00:20:21.190
Everyone together, huh?

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.780
What's wrong? Why so gloomy, Logy?

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:27.330
I can finally catch a breather.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:28.850
You've had it quite hard.

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:29.930
That's right.

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:32.010
I've done my best.

00:20:32.010 --> 00:20:35.670
Every single day, I battle with piles of documents!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:39.750
Even so, how come I still can't find myself a good partner?!

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:42.490
Don't you think it's strange too?

00:20:42.490 --> 00:20:43.830
Not really.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:48.510
Theria, don't tell me you've already given up on meeting someone!

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:52.560
Listen, we are still maidens!

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:53.850
It's too early for us to give up.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:57.350
Are you listening, Theria?!

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:57.600
Marion-san's going at it again.

00:20:57.350 --> 00:21:02.470
You can't just sit around awaiting for someone!

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:01.070
Once she starts, she's a pain to handle.

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:02.390
That's why she hasn't found anyone.

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:03.700
You there!

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.320
I can hear you!

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:10.220
Father, Mother...

00:21:10.220 --> 00:21:12.660
I'm glad I came to Colseit.

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:16.990
I learned something very important from my mentor.

00:21:16.990 --> 00:21:22.640
However, when I'm finally able to stand on my own, I want to make my dream come true.

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:26.220
Until then, please keep watching over me.

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:29.990
You guys.

00:21:29.990 --> 00:21:32.170
When job is done,

00:21:32.170 --> 00:21:34.180
report to me.

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:36.520
Otherwise, I can't pay you.

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:37.870
Pay.

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:39.320
Pay. I want.

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:41.170
That aside. Lucille.

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:42.670
That's right. Lucille.

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:44.190
I want to listen.

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:45.780
I want to listen her continue.

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.230
Lucille!

00:21:50.190 --> 00:21:54.250
Oh, Solle-san, I left the document on your desk.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:58.790
My sweets have to be better than hers.
